# Proteus Simulation

Project: Smart Boot Sanitization System

## Components
- Arduino UNO R3
- IR Sensor
- Brush Motor
- Water Pump
- Solenoid Valve
- Green LED
- Red LED
- 2N2222/MOSFET driver circuits
- 1N4007 flyback diodes
- 220Ω resistors
- External power supply

## Pin Mapping
IR Sensor       -> D2
Brush Motor     -> D3
Water Pump      -> D4
Solenoid Valve  -> D5
Green LED       -> D6
Red LED         -> D7

## Timing
Washing         -> 10 seconds
Sanitization    -> 5 seconds

## Simulation
Load boot_sanitization.hex into the Arduino UNO component and run the Proteus simulation.
